  "description": "This bright and private 1 Bedroom Apartment in Glandore Court Apartments offers comfortable living in a secure, gated development off Glandore Park in Monkstown, County Dublin.\n\nAccommodation Layout: Comprises a spacious entrance hall with laminated flooring and an an open-plan living and dining area, and a fully fitted tile-floor kitchen equipped with a washer/dryer and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom & Bathroom: Spaces bedroom with laminate floors and fitted wardrobes, alongside a fully tiled bathroom with an electric shower.\n\nAmple storage available in attic with access via fold down ladder.\n\nLocation & Convenience: Tucked away in a peaceful and exclusive setting yet within easy walking distance of Monkstown Village, Dún Laoghaire, local shops, and public transport options (including bus and DART links).\n",
